Description: OpenMediaVault plugin to spin down disks that ignore their timer
 Some hard disks, notably WD Red drives, stop honouring the standby timer
 openmediavault sets (Storage > Disks > Spindown time) and never sleep,
 although they still obey an immediate standby command. This plugin
 watches each disk's activity without waking it and, after the same
 spindown time without reads or writes, puts the disk to sleep.
